=== FLOX SYNTAX REFERENCE ===

Declarations:
  river Name { base: N, peak: N, decay: N }   (decay optional, default 0.7)
  dam   Name { capacity: N, threshold: N%, normalRate: N, openRate: N }
  outlet Name;                                (zero-flow accumulator)

Connections:
  A -> B -> C;                                (bare names; declared anywhere)

Commands:
  system Name;                  - Create a system
  list Name;                    - Show connections list
  map Name;                     - Show network diagram
  print Name;                   - Simulate with 1mm rainfall on day 1
  print Name N;                 - Simulate with N mm on day 1
  print Name [r1, r2, r3, ...]; - Per-day rainfall series in mm
  help;                         - Show this message

